---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+17035550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(703) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Ice Dams & Winter Gutter Issues Woodbridge, VA" description="Ice dams lifting gutters in Woodbridge? Prevention tips and repair after winter damage. Call (703) 555-0199.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → Problems → Ice Dams</div>
      <h1>Ice Dams in Woodbridge</h1>
      <p>Winter ice buildup can lift gutters and force water under shingles. Prevention and proper drainage help.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <p>Ice dams form when melting snow refreezes at the eaves. Keeping gutters clear and ensuring proper attic insulation and ventilation reduce the risk. After winter we inspect for bent sections, pulled hangers, and leaks and repair them before spring rains.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:2rem;text-align:center"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
